> Meaning space is formed by distinctions, shaped by models, anchored by memory and identity, activated by attention, coupled by resonance, traversed by stories and games, translated by metaphor and mathematics, compressed by symbols, embodied by ritual, and externalized by maps.

Shortest form:

> **Form. Anchor. Move. Translate. Modulate.**

Pantheon form:

> **Build the terrain. Mark the coordinates. Weight the field. Open the path. Preserve the operator.**